  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guidelines for the implementation of municipal justice with juries in Argentina.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to promote the discussion and implementation of municipal justice with juries under an Anglo-Saxon model in different cities of at least eight provinces of Argentina, involving municipal decision-makers -representatives of municipal governments and councilors- in the debate. In this sense, the project seeks to contribute to the transformation of municipal justice that the cities of Rosario, Mendoza and San Patricio del Cha&#xf1;ar have promoted, recovering its entity in the management of neighborhood conflicts, oralizing its processes and decisions, and guaranteeing citizen participation in them.</narrative>
  </description>
